      ],
      "text": "Frequency three times per day\n\n---\nEffect The zomok teleports itself with the effects of a 5th-rank Translocate spell, but the zomok must begin and end the teleportation effect in forest terrain. The zomok regains 10d10 healing Hit Points during this teleportation. Creatures swallowed by the zomok are left behind.\n\nThe zomok can't use Forest Step again for 1d6+1 rounds.",
